# D-STAT-ABORTED-BY-THE-RECOVERY-BLOCKED-CUTOFF-ENDS-ITS-INODE-DLM-HOLD-UNPAIRED:
# verification of the fix in the tree since 0.87.22 (the -EHOSTDOWN arm of
# mxfs_dlm_ilock_begin gives the fallible acquire up with -EIO,
# xfs/xfs_mxfs_ilock.c mxfs_acqfall_give_up_rc; XFS_ILOCK_MXFS_NOEND,
# xfs/xfs_inode.h, tells xfs_iunlock that no DLM end is owed when
# mxfs_ilock_fallible releases its components on the give-up path,
# xfs/xfs_mxfs_fallible.c).
#
# WHAT THE DEFECT LEFT (0.87.14, both laps s53d and s53e of
# tests/d0356_stranded_prover_return.sh): during the unmount of the node whose
# fencing attempt the gate-refusal knob keeps unprovable,
# 'P240-RBLK-EIO-ABORT ino=128 mode=3 comm=umount' followed by
# 'P71-UNDERFLOW ino=128 mode=PR state=0 dlm_mode=0 comm=umount
# un=mxfs_getattr_dlm_unlock' and no P958-GETATTR-REFUSED; and every fallible
# give-up of the blackhole laps (s586d/s586h/s589a/s595a/s606h, md5sum and
# python3 readers) left 'P71-UNDERFLOW mode=PR state=0 dlm_mode=0
# un=mxfs_ilock_fallible'.
#
# Build: the main tree, srcversion 022F8BF6763B609A9ECC7D1.  Configuration
# 2/net/mesh/direct (the record's), group g2c (test29 test30), started once
# the final verification's fw2t queue on g2c has ended.
#
# VERDICT RULES (written before the first lap):
#   VERIFIED    both d0356 laps (sav1, sav2) reach the abort (a
#               P240-RBLK-EIO-ABORT ... comm=umount line on A) and each such
#               abort is followed on A by P958-GETATTR-REFUSED rc=-5, with ZERO
#               'P71-UNDERFLOW.*un=mxfs_getattr_dlm_unlock' and ZERO
#               'un=mxfs_ilock_fallible' on either node; and both blackhole
#               laps (sav3 held_fd = the md5sum reader, sav4 held_fd_read = the
#               python3 reader) show the drop firing and the reader's acquire
#               given up (or the lap's own evidence of the fallible path), with
#               ZERO 'un=mxfs_ilock_fallible' on either node, no node shutdown,
#               and the read recovering on disarm.
#   NOT FIXED   any 'un=mxfs_getattr_dlm_unlock' or 'un=mxfs_ilock_fallible'
#               P71-UNDERFLOW line in any lap, or an abort with no
#               P958-GETATTR-REFUSED after it: attributed from its own lines.
#   VACUOUS     a d0356 lap with no P240-RBLK-EIO-ABORT comm=umount, or a
#               blackhole lap whose drop never fired, measured nothing and is
#               rerun.  A lap ending ABORT/INFRA is read from its own lines.
#   Each lap's own verdict (its RESULT line) must also be PASS: a FAIL there
#   is read before anything else.
#
# Bounds, each from its harness header: d0356 prep 300 + witnesses 10 + death
# detection 180 + A's unmount 120 + B's boot 150 + B's lone mount 300 + A's
# rejoin 300 + captures 60 = 1420 s; blackhole setup 8 x 13 + ARMED_S 180 +
# recovery 60 + captures 20 = 364 s.
1420 MXFS_GROUP=g2c MXFS_CONFIG=2/net/mesh/direct MXFS_NODE_LIST=test29,test30 tests/d0356_stranded_prover_return.sh sav1
1420 MXFS_GROUP=g2c MXFS_CONFIG=2/net/mesh/direct MXFS_NODE_LIST=test29,test30 tests/d0356_stranded_prover_return.sh sav2
364 ARMED_S=180 WORKLOAD=held_fd tests/tcp_lockreq_blackhole.sh sav3 test30 test29
364 ARMED_S=180 WORKLOAD=held_fd_read tests/tcp_lockreq_blackhole.sh sav4 test30 test29
